  <policy-marker code="6" significance="3" vocabulary="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">ACMA3 endeavors to guarantee that the enduring effects on farm incomes and the stability of food and nutritional security are sustainable. Moreover, it extends assistance to farmers in cultivating resilient agricultural practices capable of withstanding the challenges posed by climate change.</narrative>
